Songloft GDStudio Plugin

Quality fallback and data mapping are independently implemented with reference to musicdl 2.13.4:
https://github.com/CharlesPikachu/musicdl

Runtime network requests use the GD Studio public API documented at
https://music-api.gdstudio.xyz/api.php. GD Studio requests attribution to
"GD音乐台 (music.gdstudio.xyz)" and limits use to noncommercial purposes.

When GD Studio returns no playable URL for a Kuwo result, the plugin may use
the same-source Kuwo resolver approach adopted by musicsquare while preserving
the original Kuwo song ID and source:
https://github.com/CharlesPikachu/musicsquare

